        "$comment": "Read from MetaGem_Ranged and MetaGem_Bandit (2026-11-04). Mutators are Blueprints under Gems/Ranged/MetaGems/<Name>/ (and Melee). Levels are a CurveFloat (CurveData) plus Tiers (one entry per level 0..N with a label like ' +1'). Per-mutator numbers (ReloadSpeedBonus, MaxLevelDurationMax, MaxLevelStatBonus, MinValue, MaxValue) are class variables, and the behavior is in a separate Action_MetaGem_<Name> asset. Not a stats table. Only the Ranged chain was read."
