        "$comment": "Read from Ring_BlessedRing (2026-11-04). A ring is a Blueprint derived from Trinket_Base. Its effect is Blueprint logic (OnEquipped, OnUnequipped, OnEvent, ModifyInspectInfo, ...) with tuning numbers as class variables on the Blueprint (here Duration and BulwarkStacks), not rows in a stats table. FilterTags values (Defense, Relic) are row names of DataTable_ItemFilters. A reskinned ring can therefore be a child of an existing ring, but a new effect needs Blueprint graph work."
      }
